    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-θλίβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>squeeze out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				578b4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				626a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.50U.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				626
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				522a20
			</span></i> ; <i>to be forced from</i> one's position, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be crowded, cramped,</i> of troops, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.4.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>squeeze, press,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταφυλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					40.11
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, aor. 2
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκθλῐβείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.112
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>squeeze out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				342a9
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>elide</i> a letter at the beginning or end of a word, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ οἷόν τε εὑρέσθαι τὸ ῡ
					-όμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Conj.</u>
					228.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				43
			</span></i>.</div>
